  'a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p',
  'supercalifragilisticexpialidocious word',
  'hyphen-ated words like well-known and self-contained-thing',
  'a-b-c-d-e-f-g-h-i-j-k',
  'foo--bar baz---qux',
  '  leading and trailing   whitespace   ',
  'tabs\tand\nnewlines\tmixed  up',
  'one',
  '',
  'x'.repeat(50),
  'aaa bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb ccc',
  '--option-name VALUE, --other-option OTHER',
  'e-mail me at foo@bar.com or don\'t; it\'s fine.',
  'UPPER lower 12345 !@#$%^&*() end',
  'a very very very long word: antidisestablishmentarianism, plus more',
  'na-1-b co--op re-enter -leading-hyphen trailing-',
